sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Scheduler
    participant Job as smartwatch_periodic_sync job
    participant Svc as SmartwatchService
    participant GF as Google Fit API
    participant Health as HealthService
    participant DB as Database

    Scheduler->>Job: Trigger at configured interval
    Job->>Svc: sync_connected_accounts()
    Svc->>DB: get_connected_accounts()
    DB-->>Svc: accounts

    loop For each connected account
        Svc->>GF: Refresh token if near expiry
        GF-->>Svc: token or error
        alt token error
            Svc->>DB: save sync failure diagnostics
        else token valid
            Svc->>GF: fetch metrics (incremental window)
            GF-->>Svc: metric payload
            Svc->>Svc: adaptive retry for missing metric families
            alt payload complete
                Svc->>Health: ingest smart payload
                Health->>DB: insert health record and alerts
                DB-->>Health: persisted
                Svc->>DB: update sync boundary
            else payload partial
                Svc->>DB: store partial diagnostics only
            end
        end
    end

    Job-->>Scheduler: cycle summary
